Enrollment Processing Tracker: basically tracks the entire process end to end
=============================================================

Today's enrollment processing that uses mainframe technology is outdated and lacks a tracking mechanism to provide transparent insights into data processing at every stage.

 This absence of visibility makes it challenging for businesses to understand the underlying processes.

One of our key goals is to introduce a tracking system that monitors and records data onboarding, ingestion, processing, and the outcomes of these steps. 

This comprehensive visibility will empower businesses to gain a deeper understanding of the entire process, enabling them to make informed decisions.


 

Furthermore, this system will possess the ability to reprocess or replay from the point of failure, eliminating the need to start from the beginning. This feature is particularly valuable for auditing and corrective actions.

Implementation of Digital fingerprint at file level/ Record level and key attribute level is carried throughout the process, which helps with upholding data integrity, and effectively prevents any duplicate processing.


