Event store
============================
Our aim is to harness the existing Event store capability within the enterprise. 

This specific capability is designed to store each enrollment action comprehensively. It not only promptly disseminates events as they occur but also has the  functionality to generate snapshots.

Imagine scenarios where the business seeks immediate insight into events like new members or new-born enrollments, or even terminations. 

Moreover, business requirements for a time-travel snapshot of a member's journey for analysis or compliance reasons. 

This Event store stands as the solution to fulfill these objectives seamlessly. For understanding any past actions and analyzing historical data


